            "content": "Rahul sir, localhost check karne ke liye aap ye steps follow kar sakte hain:\n\n1. **Browser Open Karein:** Sabse pehle apna web browser (jaise Chrome ya Edge) open karein.\n2. **Address Bar mein Type Karein:** Address bar mein `http://localhost` ya `http://127.0.0.1` type karke Enter dabayein.\n3. **Result Check Karein:** Agar aapka koi local server (jaise XAMPP, WAMP, ya Node.js) chal raha hai, toh aapko wahan default page ya aapki application dikh jayegi.\n\n**Ek aur baat:** Agar aapko specific port check karna hai (jaise port 3000), toh aap `http://localhost:3000` type kar sakte hain.\n\nKya aapne koi server start kiya hua hai, rahul sir? Main aur kaise madad kar sakti hoon? 😊",
